                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Transcripts of semi-structured interviews, and the interview guide used during the interviews (both in Dutch). Interviews were conducted with representatives from six Dutch companies that transfer personal data to the United States of America. Since the Schrems I & II rulings by the European Court of Justice, such transfers are subject to strict rules. Object of the interviews was to explore to what extent these rulings influenced the behaviors of these companies."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
